** The first blast is released at the point-targeted direction, with the other {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Deafening Blast value4 tal}}-1}}|25tal}} projectiles adapting, with {{ValueColor||{{#var:Deafening Blast value5 tal}}|25tal}} angles between per blast.
** Deafening Blast can only affect the same enemy units once per cast.
** Multiple overlapping Deafening Blast radius do not stack.

